    "description": "The Telecom SIM Swap Batch Processing API allows businesses to efficiently handle bulk requests for SIM swaps. This endpoint is designed to streamline the process of updating SIM information for multiple customers at once, reducing manual overhead and improving operational efficiency. Typical consumers of this API include telecom service providers and system integrators who need to manage customer SIM swaps in bulk. With this API, organizations can enhance customer service and ensure timely updates to their telecom systems.",
